OL,3,GNEWSA'AI slop' art trail cost #11,688,
OL,4,Afigures reveal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art trail created by an agency using
OL,7,Fcomputer-generated designs described by
OL,8,Fone artist as "AI slop" cost #11,688, a
OL,9,FFreedom of Information request has
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FThe Giant Deckchair Trail was
OL,13,Fcommissioned by North Yorkshire Council
OL,14,Fas part of Scarborough's 400th
OL,15,Fanniversary celebrations, with each of
OL,16,Fthe 10 deckchairs depicting a moment in
OL,17,Fthe seaside town's history.
OL,19,FDozens of artists and residents in the
OL,20,Fresort previously said they were
OL,21,F"deeply disappointed" by the
OL,22,Fauthority's decision to use AI.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
